05. PUT speed/value ?datasetId=urn:ds:unknown - 404
===================================================
HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 228

{
  "detail": "no instance of attribute 'speed' with datasetId 'urn:ds:unknown' on entity 'urn:V1'",
  "status": 404,
  "title": "Attribute instance not found",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/ResourceNotFound"
}



